        "runId": "ada-en-amanda-mw6juwms-in2zy2i",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "We arrange chauffeured transfers from your hotel to the conference at Windsor Oceânico and back. If you have time between business meetings, we can arrange a shopping trip."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:a0a7104497c6c0c8",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "e6f359cf21cf4bce16a65a8e2d6b2f6635f4004c8dc8ec46222b9cdddf46df0c",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-amanda-mw6juwms-in2zy2i",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "We arrange a six-hour shopping programme with an English-speaking guide and pick-up at Windsor Oceânico. We coordinate the departure time and attendee list around your business schedule."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:17c040f37a742dd2",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "49f301b93c0a6f94c32e1cc7e317671802e9dbdefc4fb89bd352f346cc236ce4",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-amanda-mw6juwms-in2zy2i",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "In the evening, join us for a buffet dinner at Siqueira Grill. Restaurant transfers and an escort are included."
    },
